  "limits": [
    "Bounded static witness, not native execution or proof of actual Yi dispatch, live shader selection, later overrides or visual parity.",
    "Emitter field +0xf0 minus per-particle array +0x10 is consistent with age; clock units and array producers are not established here. Array +0xa0 is consumed as a fraction; its RNG distribution and relation to the local indexed sampler are not established.",
    "Quad primitive gate accepts kinds 0 and 1; default CameraQuad kind 0 is separately witnessed. Ray and mesh paths must be traced independently.",
    "ARM64 half conversions use the active floating-point environment. Round-to-nearest-even examples are conditional on that rounding mode; this witness does not attest live FPCR.",
    "Fresh LLVM 19 text retains the original AIR target. It is additional evidence, not a replacement for missing historical LLVM archives. Shader fast-math transformations and actual GPU arithmetic are not attested.",
    "No runtime correction is included in this evidence checkpoint; the current sampler retains integer-first atlas selection.",
    "The inherited full suite remains 3077 passing out of 3079, with the same two baseline failures."
  ],
